  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1206.08 Operation of Gate Valves",
  "priorExpiration": "2010-04-19",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1206.08 Operation of Gate Valves. The PORS O/O shall cause all gate valves in the PORS to be fully turned at least once every 12 months, timed to coincide with periods of minimum consumer usage.\n\nSource. #9572, INTERIM, eff 10-21-09, EXPIRES: 4-19-10; ss by #9660, eff 2-24-10; ss by #12582, eff 7-24-18",
